{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbEvv47thPzdi9YuSFw3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018We3qHwLjuW6fhhqP5pSpc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> cores/bench/implementation_notes.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Tests added\n`cores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py`: `jal_predicted_no_bubble` (JAL target retires the next cycle) and\n`bimodal_loop_trains_and_retires_correctly` (BNE loop: exact retirement PC sequence, pc_wdata/pc_rdata\ncontinuity, trained taken iterations retire back-to-back). All 13 pipeline tests pass; whole cocotb suite passes.\nEOF\nverilator --lint-only -Wall -Wno-MULTITOP -sv +incdir+cores/bench/rtl cores/bench/rtl/*.sv 2>&1 | grep -c -i warning","description":"Append test notes and re-lint"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1088,"cache_read_input_tokens":109386,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1088},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a17846b7-0d47-40a4-b7f7-09328e3ceaf3","uuid":"396ba783-1b4e-474f-9c98-e2578f2a8e01","timestamp":"2026-10-01T08:58:20.843Z","request_id":"req_011CfbEvucKnqDVmBcLtmrAX"}
